Go to end. Say "skipped". Label end. Say "reached". Set n to 0. Label again. Add 1 to n. If n is less than 3 then: Go to again. End if. Say n. Set found to 0. For i from 1 to 5: If i is equal to 3 then: Go to hit. End if. End for. Set found to 1. Label hit. Say found. Set x to 2. Switch x: When 1: Say "one". Break. When 2: Go to two. Break. Otherwise: Say "other". End switch. Label two. Say "exited". Procedure classify takes n as long integer returns long integer: If n is equal to 0 then: Go to zero. End if. Return 1. Label zero. Return 0. End procedure. Say Call classify with 5 done. Say Call classify with 0 done.